<title>USA: Revlon to refinance facility, redeem debt.</title>
<headline>Revlon to refinance facility, redeem debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revlon Inc said on Monday that its Revlon Consumer Products Corp subsidiary signed a commitment letter for a new credit facility to refinance its current facility with more favorable rates and to redeem Revlon's 10-7/8 percent sinking fund debentures due 2010.</p>
<p>Revlon said Chase Securites Inc agreed to arrange a new $750 million facility, subject to syndication, due diligence and other conditions.</p>
</text>
